<title>UK: TMCC sets 100 mln rand one-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>TMCC sets 100 mln rand one-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.75     MATURITY    25.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9137  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
